From 25c8d917cef88aaf3d573a2c37b3a7e567d02bb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:02:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 44/52] drm/gma500: dual-license the sgxfive driver as
 GPL-2.0-only OR MIT

The sgxfive files are written from scratch for this driver; they use kernel
APIs but copy no GPL-only kernel code. The firmware loader (sgx_fw.*), the
command sequencer and transfer builders (sgx_seq.*, sgx_xfer.*) and the
sgxfive uapi header are already dual-licensed. License the rest of sgxfive/
the same way, as the imagination (powervr) driver is, so its code can be
shared with userspace and other kernels.

gma500's side (gma_sgx.[ch]) and the edits to existing gma500 files stay
GPL-2.0-only.

Assisted-by: LLM
